{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"thread\": \"一个原本小心翼翼、总把喜欢藏起来的人，在与对方亲近的陪伴中反复想说又忍住，最终终于坦白。即使仍然害怕失去、担心对方未必同样需要自己，他还是选择珍惜当下，继续真诚地表达喜欢，不再强求永远。\",\n  \"sections\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"caught\": \"心动却不敢说\",\n      \"echo\": \"\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"caught\": \"亲近安心仍克制\",\n      \"echo\": \"S01\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"caught\": \"贪恋当下难开口\",\n      \"echo\": \"S02\",\n      \"why\": \"勉强\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"caught\": \"想说却仍忍住\",\n      \"echo\": \"S01、S03\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"caught\": \"表露后反而慌乱\",\n      \"echo\": \"S04\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"caught\": \"安心之下仍孤独\",\n      \"echo\": \"S02、S05\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"caught\": \"猜他也需要陪伴\",\n      \"echo\": \"S06\",\n      \"why\": \"勉强\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S08\",\n      \"caught\": \"开始轻松回应\",\n      \"echo\": \"S05\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"caught\": \"怕他不再需要我\",\n      \"echo\": \"S06、S07\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"caught\": \"不猜以后先活此刻\",\n      \"echo\": \"S03、S09\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"caught\": \"坦白喜欢仍怕不被需要\",\n      \"echo\": \"S01、S09\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"caught\": \"倾尽心意想多陪伴\",\n      \"echo\": \"S11\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"caught\": \"幸福真实却怕失去\",\n      \"echo\": \"S04、S09\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S14\",\n      \"caught\": \"不求永远仍坦白\",\n      \"echo\": \"S01、S13\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"overall\": \"最吃力的是 S06—S09，亲密、欲望、孤独和对方是否也需要自己几种情绪交织在一起，意象比较密集，不容易马上理清。最抓人的是 S04—S05 和 S13—S14：前面反复想说却没说出口，后面终于坦白，又逐渐接受美好不一定永远持续，形成了很清楚的情绪闭环。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d79ddd5e-c05a-4e41-9839-0bf05399e642", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T185306896281Z", "elapsed_seconds": 36.734, "completed_utc": "2026-11-05T18:53:43.630945+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "07375a0c153761cb3ffc8e3cb7522bbb539c19d4eb1ef80431bd53afa1ea4dbc", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T185306896281Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "b536fdd904f975682a0993259631c233c6272df125e8f339022af83c25943826"}}}
